WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.500
Wondering what to charge?

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:12.900
Pricing pages are scattered, and half of them change quietly.

3
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:16.900
Here they are side by side.

4
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:25.600
Thirty-nine dollars, forty-nine, and nothing. Copied from their own price pages.

5
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:32.100
Quote them in a plan without checking. And you can see where yours would sit.

6
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:40.100
Freshroute publishes no price at all.

7
00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:47.800
That is a fact about them, not a hole here. Companies that hide prices chase bigger customers.

8
00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:52.200
So it says not published, rather than guessing.

9
00:00:52.200 --> 00:01:00.200
A blog says Freshroute starts at a hundred and twenty.

10
00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:08.000
You get the number and you get to judge it. Not from the company, so it stays out of the table.

11
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:13.800
Nothing unproven is dressed up as fact. What each one does is next.
